, "search": true}], "notes": ["2019 Three Six Zero Recordings/Sony Music Entertainment"]}, {"t": 6720, "time": "01:52:00", "artist": "Matt Star", "title": "Almond", "conf": "low", "links": [{"label": "bandcamp", "url": "https://bandcamp.com/search?q=Matt+Star+Almond", "search": true}, {"label": "youtube", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Matt+Star+Almond", "search": true}, {"label": "soundcloud", "url": "https://soundcloud.com/search?q=Matt+Star+Almond", "search": true}, {"label": "spotify", "url": "https://open.spotify.com/search/Matt+Star+Almond", "search": true}, {"label": "apple", "url": "https://music.apple.com/au/search?term=Matt+Star+Almond", "search": true}, {"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/search/Matt+Star+Almond", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=Matt+Star+Almond&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": []}, {"t": 6957, "time": "01:55:57", "artist": "Tiga & Budino", "title": "ECSTASY SURROUNDS ME (Budino Remix)", "conf": "mid", "links": [{"label": "bandcamp", "url": "https://bandcamp.com/search?q=Tiga+%26+Budino+ECSTASY+SURROUNDS+ME+%28Budino+Remix%29", "search": true}, {"label": "youtube", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Tiga+%26+Budino+ECSTASY+SURROUNDS+ME+%28Budino+Remix%29", "search": true}, {"label": "soundcloud", "url": "https://soundcloud.com/search?q=Tiga+%26+Budino+ECSTASY+SURROUNDS+ME+%28Budino+Remix%29", "search": true}, {"label": "spotify", "url": "https://open.spotify.com/search/Tiga+%26+Budino+ECSTASY+SURROUNDS+ME+%28Budino+Remix%29", "search": true}, {"label": "apple", "url": "https://music.apple.com/au/song/6812895825", "search": false}, {"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/search/Tiga+%26+Budino+ECSTASY+SURROUNDS+ME+%28Budino+Remix%29", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=Tiga+%26+Budino+ECSTASY+SURROUNDS+ME+%28Budino+Remix%29&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["2026 Secret City Records"]}], "counts": {"high": 1, "mid": 9, "low": 8}, "transcripts": [{"start": "00:01:57", "end": "00:02:20", "text": "Alright, it is 6.02pm, which means it's time for Sunset with Motorik here on FBi 94.5. Massive props to Ruby and Al, as always, holding down the incredible Arvo's fort."}, {"start": "00:21:06", "end": "00:21:23", "text": "If you want to let me know what you think of cricket, positive or negative, we accept all perspectives here on FBi Radio. Chuck me a text 0435 123 945."}, {"start": "00:46:04", "end": "00:47:00", "text": "You're listening to Sunset with Motorik on FBi 94.5. This is Pull Up, the Mike Simonetti remix. On Rollover Milano Records, we actually had the head of Rollover Milano Records, Rocco, in on the show a few months ago. You can listen back to that on the FBi Radio website. Very excited to announce that Australia only need 43 runs in 37.5 overs to win the ODI against England. But unfortunately, the bison was out on 50. But Matt Renshaw is at the crease. But that could mean anything now. Jeez. It's just too unpredictable. Yeah. Lucy, my very special guest in the studio. Hello."}, {"start": "00:47:10", "end": "00:48:45", "text": "Nice. Is this your first time on radio? Yeah. Absolutely. Happy to facilitate. Shout out to the anonymous texter who said, keep the cricket talk going. I believe Khawaja. You can believe whatever you want to believe. But I believe my boy, Patti C. Oh, there you go. I'll give you the context, actually. I sort of did give you the context, but look, we cheated. Australia cheated. Happens. Happens. It happens all the time. That's the thing. It happens all the time. And then it happened eight years ago. All the punishments were dealt with. And then one of the guys who was in the team has coincidentally decided that in conjunction with the release of his new book, he's come forth with the accusation that all the members of the team knew that the cheating was going to happen before it took place. Oh, okay, yes. And the current captain of the team was in the team when that happened. And he's saying, what are you talking about? Like, that wasn't the story. Or like, that's not what happened. I wasn't aware of it. And regardless of whether they knew about it or not, I think it's just time to put this aside. Everyone served their penalties that are many branded too harsh. Too harsh a punishment. So they're saying, like, this was all dealt with. They dealt with so much abuse online and they're still copying abuse from it."}, {"start": "00:49:40", "end": "00:52:33", "text": "And I think it's just an opportunity for a lot of people to just, like, give their two cents now. And like I said, I feel like we've reached the point where we can put all this behind us. Shout out to Terry, who gave a great analogy that FBI, Sunset with Motorik, are the defenders of test cricket at FBI. I'll happily take that position and said that he feels like that we'd be sympathetic to Sandpaper Gate the way that DJs are partial to scratching. Ooh, I don't know if it's like that. I think it's sort of the analogy would be we are to Sandpaper Gate as, like, you know, people are to pre-recording sets or DJing with sync. As in, like, it's kind of cheating, but everybody does it. Yeah, I see. You know, and I think that beyond what's happened, we have well proved beyond that, that we are great at test cricket. Just make sure the track's not finishing. Do you want to keep talking, Lucy? Hold for effect, everyone. Yeah, yeah, just tell. You're just checking the track. Do you want to just let me know what you found out about cricket on the show? Just give me a recap. Wow, well, this has been nothing but insightful for myself who has not followed cricket. But it is good to have such a fan amongst us. We are very lucky to have Rini's knowledge right here with us. Normally I have the Santa Maria brothers, who also have a really good knowledge of cricket. Yes, yes. Sadly, they are not with us today. So you have to sta